{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35875","headline":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 三 · 李咸用","name":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫言天道终难定，须信人心尽自轻。\n宣室三千虽有恨，成周八百岂无情。\n栢缘执性长时瘦，梅爲多知两番生。\n不是不同明主意，嬾将唇舌与齐烹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}